    rdf:value """Saturday, Oct. 5, 1907
I Tatti.
Scott.
I took Scott to the Uffizi. He was rather better. But the Venus quite failed, to our disgust. We thoroughly enjoyed the Annunciation of Simone Martini.
B.B. at Nervi."""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 300 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1907> .

